    <string name="string_rn_title">What\'s New</string>
    <string name="string_rn_v2_4_4">v2.4.4\n- Added full localization support including Hebrew.\n- Introduced \'What\'s New\' screen in the Help section.\n- Revamped Volunteer Translation screen with dynamic strings and progress indicators.\n- Extracted remaining hardcoded strings for complete translation.</string>
    <string name="string_rn_v2_4_3">v2.4.3\n- Fixed sharing screen issues and incorrect titles.\n- Resolved mojibake text corruption in settings.</string>
    <string name="string_rn_v2_4_2">v2.4.2\n- Improved background audio extraction and video processing.\n- Enhanced Gemini AI error handling.</string>
    <string name="string_rn_v1">v1.0.0\n- Initial release of Accessible Video Editor with basic video/audio editing tools optimized for screen readers.</string>
